            "offset": 110,
            "infons": {
              "section_type": "ABSTRACT",
              "type": "abstract"
            },
            "text": "Treatment of cystic fibrosis‐related chronic rhinosinusitis should target sinonasal biofilms.",
            "sentences": [],
            "annotations": [],
            "relations": []
          },
          {
            "bioctype": "BioCPassage",
            "offset": 206,
            "infons": {
              "section_type": "ABSTRACT",
              "type": "abstract"
            },
            "text": "NaHCO3 salts with/without xylitol have limited antibiofilm properties, whereas rhDNAse has not.",
            "sentences": [],
            "annotations": [],
            "relations": []
          },
          {
            "bioctype": "BioCPassage",
            "offset": 302,
            "infons": {
              "section_type": "ABSTRACT",
              "type": "abstract"
            },
            "text": "Phage effectivity varies and depends on the phage and the combination with antibiotics.",
            "sentences": [],
            "annotations": [],
            "relations": []
          },
          {
            "bioctype": "BioCPassage",
            "offset": 390,
            "infons": {
              "section_type": "INTRO",
