            },
            "text": "Abbreviations: CRSsNP, chronic rhinosinusitis without nasal polyps; CRSwNP, chronic rhinosinusitis with nasal polyps; CT, computed tomography; FESS, functional endoscopic sinus surgery; I, intermediate; ISP, intravenous staphylococcal phage; R, resistant; S, sensitive; TSB, tryptic soy broth.",
